 "stimulus_html": "In the following exercises, you are about to draw <i>Scrabble</i> tiles from a bag; the bag contains the letters A, A, C, E, E, E, L, L, N, O, R, S, S, S, T, X.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 516742,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "If you draw 1 tile at random, compute<br>\n<ol type=\"a\">\n<li><span data-math=\"P\\left({\\text{tile shows A}}\\right)\">P({\\text{tile shows A}})</span></li>\n<li><span data-math=\"P\\left(\\text{tile shows A}\\,|\\,\\text{tile shows a vowel}\\right)\">P({\\text{tile shows A}}|{\\text{tile shows a vowel}})</span></li>\n</ol>",
